# Quicksense Dashboard — local workflow

## Git
- Work on **`main`** directly. Do **not** create feature branches or pull requests unless the user explicitly asks.
- Commit and push to `origin main` after meaningful changes.
- Keep changes focused in `index.html` unless adding dev tooling.

## Running locally
- Single-page app: `index.html` at repo root.
- Start dev server: `npm run dev` → **http://localhost:3000**
- Clip of the Week page: **http://localhost:3000/#cow**
- Hard refresh or add `?v=1` if the browser caches an old build.

## Project notes
- GitHub Pages live URL: https://quicksensegoated.github.io/Quicksense-Dashboard/
- Clip of the Week: max 3 clips, 1 per browser, community upload + voting.
- Uploaded MP4s use IndexedDB (device-local); link-based clips sync via JSONBin/localStorage.
